      "explanation": "Tight junetions are not segn'in cardiac muscle.\nTight junctions form a water-tight seal between cells. They are characteristically seen in the\nfollowing:\n¢ Intestinal mucosa\n¢ Renal tubules\n* Choroid plexus\n* Sertoli cells\nFunctions of tight junctions are:\n¢ Prevents the diffusion of macromolecules between cells.\n¢ Maintains cell polarity.\n* Seals the paracellular pathway."
